## Революция ОФСК (Объединённый Фронт Свободных Колоний)

dh-role-type-front = United Front of Free Colonies

dh-revolution-republic-sender = Republican Army Corps

dh-revolution-sponsored-briefing = The United Independent Colonies are sponsoring this uprising. Elijah-Capital has delivered weapons stolen from a Republican Army Corps depot: an access breaker and an RPR-M-9-02 submachine gun with a spare magazine are in your bag. The Republic knows its weapons are missing — trust no one.

dh-revolution-theft-announcement = Attention all personnel in system REP-27. During an armed raid on a Republican Army Corps supply depot, several units of military equipment were stolen, including RPR-M-9-02 submachine guns and access breakers. Military intelligence links the theft to cells of the United Front of Free Colonies operating in the system. Security personnel are to remain vigilant and report any sighting of Republican military weapons in civilian hands.

dh-revolution-station-fallen = The command of the station has been overthrown by separatists of the United Front of Free Colonies. The United Republic does not negotiate with terrorists and will not tolerate a separatist foothold in its territory. Stand by for the decree of the Supreme Command.

dh-alert-level-deadend-revolution-announcement = By decree of the Supreme Command of the United Republic, the crew of this station is found guilty of high treason and separatism for surrendering the station to the terrorists of the United Front of Free Colonies. The Republican citizenship and all civil rights of every member of the crew are annulled. The entire crew is placed on the Republic's wanted list. The station is condemned. A reinforced Republic sweep team is en route with orders to suppress the separatists, eliminate all resistance and destroy the station with a tactical nuclear warhead. There will be no evacuation. Glory to the United Republic!
